<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's Agadir airport traffic up in May 97.</title>
<headline>Morocco's Agadir airport traffic up in May 97.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger traffic at Morocco's southern Agadir airport rose to 64,300 in May this year from 60,374 in the same period in 1996, the official news agency MAP said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The increase was attributed mainly to a 23.98 percent rise in the number of foreign travellers. Local passenger traffic increased by 7.7 percent.</p>
</text>
